slug: serious-pathology-masquerading-msk-pain
title: Scary Things That Look Like Muscle Pain
area: Clinical Reasoning
level: Clinical
best: Final year onwards
minutes: 14
hook: Most back, neck and shoulder pain is harmless. A few are not: cancer, infection, a fracture, a leaking artery, a heart attack. They can look exactly like a strained muscle. This lesson teaches the pattern that should make you stop and refer. || Zyada tar kamar, gardan aur kandhe ka dard bezarar hota hai. Kuch nahi hote: cancer, infection, fracture, phatti hui sharyaan, heart attack. Yeh bilkul kheenche hue muscle jaise lag sakte hain. Yeh lesson woh pattern sikhata hai jo aap ko rok kar refer karne par majboor kare.
goal: By the end, you'll sort pain into "behaves like a mechanical problem" or "does not", name the main serious causes by body system, use clusters of clues instead of single red flags, and say the right words to the patient when you refer. || End tak aap dard ko "mechanical jaisa" ya "mechanical nahi" mein baant sakenge, body system ke hisaab se bari wajahon ke naam lenge, akeli red flag ke bajaye clues ka cluster istemal karenge, aur refer karte waqt mareez se sahi alfaaz kahenge.

say: Muscle and joint pain has a **personality**. Mechanical pain changes with movement and position: worse with some postures, better with others, easier at rest. Serious pathology often has a different personality: **constant, unrelenting, not changed by position, worse at night, or arriving with the body as a whole unwell**. Your first job in every assessment is not to find the muscle. It is to ask: does this pain behave like a mechanical problem? || Muscle aur joint ke dard ki ek **shakhsiyat** hoti hai. Mechanical dard harkat aur position se badalta hai: kuch postures mein zyada, kuch mein kam, aaram mein behtar. Serious bimari ki shakhsiyat aksar alag hoti hai: **musalsal, bina ruke, position se na badalne wala, raat mein zyada, ya poore jism ki kamzori ke saath**. Har assessment mein aap ka pehla kaam muscle dhoondna nahi. Poochna hai: kya yeh dard mechanical jaisa behave kar raha hai?
analogy: Think of a **smoke alarm**. It rings for burnt toast far more often than for a real fire, and nobody throws the alarm away because of that. Red flags work the same way: most are false alarms, but you never switch the alarm off. You check every time, quickly and calmly, and you are not embarrassed when it is toast. || **Smoke alarm** sochein. Yeh jali hui roti par asli aag se kahin zyada bajta hai, aur is wajah se koi alarm phenkta nahi. Red flags bhi aise hain: zyada tar jhoothe alarm hote hain, lekin alarm kabhi band nahi karte. Har baar jaldi aur sukoon se check karein, aur roti nikle to sharminda na hon.
compare: The main serious causes, by body system || Bari wajahon ki fehrist, body system ke hisaab se
head: System || Nizam ;; Clues that should worry you || Jo clues pareshan karein ;; What you do || Aap kya karein
row: Cancer (primary or spread) || Cancer ;; Past cancer, age over 50 with new pain, unexplained weight loss, night pain not eased by rest || Pehle cancer, 50 se upar naya dard, wajah ke baghair wazan kam, aaram se na jaane wala raat ka dard ;; Stop, refer for medical review the same week or sooner || Rukein, usi haftay ya jald medical review ke liye refer
row: Infection (spine, joint, bone) || Infection ;; Fever, recent infection or surgery, injections, diabetes or weak immunity, hot swollen joint, severe pain at any movement || Bukhaar, haal ki infection ya surgery, injections, diabetes ya kamzor immunity, garam soojha joint, har harkat par shadeed dard ;; Urgent medical assessment, do not load or manipulate || Foran medical assessment, load ya manipulation nahi
row: Fracture || Fracture ;; Significant fall or crash, osteoporosis or long-term steroids, older age, sudden sharp pain, deformity || Bada girna ya hadsa, osteoporosis ya lambay arsay ke steroids, buzurgi, achanak tez dard, deformity ;; Imaging first, protect the area || Pehle imaging, hissay ki hifazat
row: Nerve compression, cauda equina || Nerve dabao, cauda equina ;; Numbness between the legs, new bladder or bowel change, both legs weak, sexual numbness || Taangon ke beech sunn, peshab ya pakhaane ki nai tabdeeli, dono taangon mein kamzori, jinsi hissay mein sunn ;; Emergency: same-day hospital || Emergency: usi din hospital
row: Blood vessels || Khoon ki naliyan ;; Tearing pain with a pulsing belly (aortic aneurysm), one swollen painful calf (clot), arm pain with cold pale hand || Phatne jaisa dard aur dhadakta pait (aortic aneurysm), ek soojhi dard bhari pindli (clot), thanda zard haath ke saath bazu ka dard ;; Emergency or same-day medical review || Emergency ya usi din medical review
row: Heart and lung || Dil aur phephre ;; Pain with exertion, sweating, nausea, breathlessness, jaw or left arm spread, not changed by neck or shoulder movement || Mehnat par dard, paseena, matli, saans ki tangi, jabray ya bayen bazu mein phailna, gardan ya kandhay ki harkat se na badalna ;; Stop, sit, vital signs, call for help || Rukein, bithayein, vital signs, madad bulayein
row: Organs (kidney, gallbladder, pancreas, womb, bowel) || Andar ke aaza ;; Pain unrelated to movement, with fever, vomiting, urine or period changes, or after eating || Harkat se unrelated dard, bukhaar, ulti, peshab ya mahwari ki tabdeeli, khane ke baad dard ;; Refer to a doctor; explain why || Doctor ko refer karein; wajah samjhayein
steps: A 60-second screen before you touch || Chhoone se pehle 60 second ki screen
step: Behaviour :: Does movement or position change it? Is it constant, or worse at night even at rest? || Behaviour :: Kya harkat ya position se badalta hai? Kya musalsal hai, ya aaram mein bhi raat ko zyada?
step: Body :: Fever, chills, night sweats, unexplained weight loss, loss of appetite, feeling generally unwell. || Jism :: Bukhaar, kapkapi, raat ka paseena, wajah ke baghair wazan kam, bhook kam, aam taur par bemari ka ehsaas.
step: Background :: Past cancer, osteoporosis, steroids, recent surgery or infection, injections, diabetes, immune problems, a major fall. || Pas-e-manzar :: Pehle cancer, osteoporosis, steroids, haal ki surgery ya infection, injections, diabetes, immunity ki kamzori, bada girna.
step: Nerves and vessels :: New numbness or weakness, bladder or bowel change, saddle numbness, swollen painful calf, cold pale limb, tearing pain. || Nerves aur naliyan :: Naya sunn ya kamzori, peshab ya pakhaane ki tabdeeli, saddle sunn, soojhi dard bhari pindli, thanda zard hissa, phatne jaisa dard.
check: A 58-year-old woman has had mid-back pain for 5 weeks. It is worse at night, is not changed by position, and she has lost 5 kilograms without trying. She had breast cancer 6 years ago. What do you do? || 58 saal ki khatoon ko 5 haftay se peeth ke beech ka dard hai. Raat ko zyada hai, position se nahi badalta, aur bina koshish ke 5 kilo wazan kam hua hai. 6 saal pehle breast cancer tha. Aap kya karein?
ok: Stop, explain your concern and refer for a medical review within days || Rukein, apni fikr samjhayein aur chand dinon mein medical review ke liye refer karein || Yes — past cancer, new night pain and weight loss form a cluster that needs a doctor. || Haan — pehle cancer, naya raat ka dard aur wazan ka kam hona aisa cluster hai jisko doctor chahiye.
no: Start a posture and stretching programme and review in four weeks || Posture aur stretching programme shuru karein aur chaar haftay baad review || That treats a muscle while the clues point elsewhere. || Yeh muscle ka ilaaj hai jabke clues kahin aur ishara kar rahe hain.
no: Apply heat and soft tissue release to the painful area || Dard wale hissay par garmi aur soft tissue release || It could delay a diagnosis and could be unsafe. || Isse diagnosis mein der ho sakti hai aur yeh ghair mehfooz ho sakta hai.
mistake: **Trusting one red flag alone.** Many red flags are common in harmless back pain, so a single one has weak predictive power. A cluster, or a flag that fits the story (cancer history plus night pain plus weight loss), matters far more. The opposite mistake is just as bad: ignoring a strong cluster because the muscle test reproduced the pain. || **Sirf ek red flag par bharosa.** Bohat si red flags aam bezarar kamar dard mein bhi hoti hain, isliye akeli ek ki predictive taqat kamzor hai. Cluster, ya aisi flag jo kahani se milti ho (cancer ka record, raat ka dard aur wazan ka kam hona), kahin zyada ahem hai. Ulta ghalat bhi utna hi bura hai: mazboot cluster ko nazar-andaaz karna sirf is liye ke muscle test ne dard dohra diya.
check: Which finding alone is MOST concerning for cauda equina syndrome? || Cauda equina syndrome ke liye akeli kaun si cheez sab se zyada pareshan kun hai?
ok: New numbness between the legs and difficulty passing urine || Taangon ke beech naya sunn aur peshab karne mein mushkil || Yes — saddle numbness with bladder change is an emergency needing same-day hospital care. || Haan — saddle sunn ke saath peshab ki tabdeeli emergency hai, usi din hospital chahiye.
no: Back stiffness in the morning that eases in 20 minutes || Subah ki akdan jo 20 minute mein theek ho jaye || That is common in mechanical or inflammatory problems and is not an emergency pattern. || Yeh mechanical ya inflammatory masle mein aam hai aur emergency pattern nahi.
no: Pain that is worse after a long walk and better when sitting || Lambay chalne ke baad zyada, baithne par kam dard || That is a mechanical pattern. || Yeh mechanical pattern hai.
check: A 41-year-old with poorly controlled diabetes has severe low back pain, a fever and a recent spinal injection. Any movement hurts. What is the safest plan? || 41 saal ke mareez ko, jiski diabetes control mein nahi, shadeed kamar dard, bukhaar hai aur haal hi mein reedh ka injection laga hai. Har harkat dukhti hai. Sab se mehfooz plan kya hai?
ok: Do not treat; arrange urgent medical assessment for possible spinal infection || Ilaaj nahi; mumkin spinal infection ke liye urgent medical assessment karwayein || Yes — fever, diabetes, a recent injection and pain with every movement form an infection cluster. || Haan — bukhaar, diabetes, haal ka injection aur har harkat par dard infection ka cluster banate hain.
no: Gentle mobilisation to restore movement || Harkat wapas laane ke liye halki mobilisation || Moving an infected spine is unsafe and delays treatment. || Infection wali reedh ko hilana ghair mehfooz hai aur ilaaj mein der karta hai.
no: Heat and massage, then review next week || Garmi aur massage, phir agle haftay review || That treats a symptom while a serious cause is possible. || Yeh symptom ka ilaaj hai jabke serious wajah mumkin hai.
clinic: **Say it simply and calmly.** For example: "Your pain is behaving in a way that makes me want a doctor to check it first. This is most likely not serious, but some of what you describe is not typical muscle pain, and it is safer to be sure. I will write down what I found so the doctor has it." Never say the word cancer unless you are the right person to; never promise that it is nothing. || **Saada aur sukoon se kahein.** Misaal: "Aap ka dard aise behave kar raha hai ke main chahta hoon pehle doctor check kar le. Zyada imkaan hai ke yeh serious nahi, lekin aap ki kuch baatein aam muscle dard jaisi nahi, aur yaqeen karna zyada mehfooz hai. Jo main ne dekha woh likh deta hoon taake doctor ke paas ho." Cancer ka lafz tab tak na kahein jab tak aap sahi shakhs na hon; yeh kabhi na kahein ke kuch nahi hai.
reveal: Why is a patient with a clear "muscle pain" test result still not safe to treat if the night pain and weight loss are there? || Jab raat ka dard aur wazan ka kam hona maujood ho to saaf "muscle dard" wala test hone par bhi mareez ka ilaaj mehfooz kyun nahi? || Because pain can be reproduced by pressing or moving almost any sore area, serious or not. A reproduced symptom proves that the area is tender; it does not prove the cause. The history and the cluster decide whether you treat or refer. || Kyunke taqreeban har dukhte hissay ko dabane ya hilane se dard dohraya ja sakta hai, chahe serious ho ya na ho. Dohraya hua symptom sirf yeh sabit karta hai ke hissa nazuk hai; wajah sabit nahi karta. Treat ya refer ka faisla history aur cluster karte hain.
case: A 66-year-old man has had right shoulder and arm pain for 3 days. It comes on when he walks fast uphill, with a feeling of pressure in the chest and sweating, and it eases after 10 minutes of rest. His neck and shoulder movements are normal and pressing the shoulder does not change it. || The pattern is exertional, with chest pressure and sweating, and is relieved by rest, while neck and shoulder movement make no difference. This suggests angina rather than a shoulder problem. || Do not treat the shoulder. Stop activity, take his pulse and blood pressure, explain your concern, and arrange urgent same-day medical assessment; call emergency services if the pain returns at rest or is severe. || He is seen the same day, an ECG and further testing are arranged, and you document your findings in a note for the doctor. The shoulder can be reviewed later if it is still painful.
safety: **When in doubt, refer, and never delay for a scan or a second opinion.** Never apply deep pressure, manipulation, heat or strong loading to a patient with a possible fracture, infection, clot, aneurysm or heart problem. If new bladder or bowel change, saddle numbness, a swollen painful calf, a tearing pain or chest pain with sweating appears, treat it as an emergency. || **Shak ho to refer karein, aur scan ya doosri raay ka intezar karke der na karein.** Mumkin fracture, infection, clot, aneurysm ya dil ke masle wale mareez par gehra dabao, manipulation, garmi ya tez loading kabhi na karein. Agar naya peshab ya pakhaane ka masla, saddle sunn, soojhi dard bhari pindli, phatne jaisa dard ya paseenay ke saath seene ka dard aaye to ise emergency samjhein.
evidence: Single red flags are weak tests. A systematic review of red flags for fracture and malignancy in low back pain found that most individual flags have limited accuracy, and that combinations such as past cancer plus other clues were more useful. An international framework (Finucane 2020) therefore advises clinicians to weigh clusters, context and patient trajectory instead of ticking boxes. || Akeli red flags kamzor tests hain. Kamar dard mein fracture aur malignancy ki red flags ke systematic review ne dikhaya ke zyada tar akeli flags ki accuracy mehdood hai, aur combinations jaise pehle cancer ke saath dusre clues zyada mufeed thay. Isliye international framework (Finucane 2020) kehta hai ke boxes tick karne ke bajaye clusters, context aur mareez ke raaste ko tolein.
memory: **Behave, Body, Background, Blood and nerves.** Four B questions: does it behave mechanically, is the body unwell, does the background raise the risk, and are there nerve or blood vessel signs? Any "no" to the first with a "yes" to another: stop and think. || **Behave, Body, Background, Blood aur nerves.** Chaar B sawal: kya mechanical behave karta hai, kya jism bemar hai, kya background khatra barhata hai, aur kya nerve ya khoon ki nali ke signs hain? Pehle par "nahi" aur kisi aur par "haan": rukein aur sochein.
summary: Ask first whether the pain behaves like a mechanical problem; if not, slow down and look for the cause. || Pehle poochhein ke dard mechanical jaisa behave karta hai ya nahi; agar nahi to ruk kar wajah dhoondein.
summary: Single red flags are weak; clusters and flags that fit the story are strong, and a strong cluster means stop and refer. || Akeli red flags kamzor hain; clusters aur kahani se milti flags mazboot hain, aur mazboot cluster ka matlab hai rukna aur refer karna.
summary: Refer calmly and clearly, document what you found, and never treat or manipulate while a serious cause is possible. || Sukoon aur wazahat se refer karein, jo dekha woh likhein, aur jab tak serious wajah mumkin ho ilaaj ya manipulation na karein.
card: What is the first question in every assessment? || Har assessment ka pehla sawal kya hai? || Does the pain behave like a mechanical problem? || Kya dard mechanical jaisa behave karta hai?
card: Which symptom needs same-day hospital care? || Kaun si alamat ko usi din hospital chahiye? || Saddle numbness with new bladder or bowel change. || Saddle sunn ke saath peshab ya pakhaane ki nai tabdeeli.
card: Why are single red flags weak? || Akeli red flags kamzor kyun hain? || Many occur in harmless back pain; clusters that fit the story are more useful. || Bohat si bezarar kamar dard mein bhi hoti hain; kahani se milte clusters zyada mufeed hain.
card: What are the four B questions? || Chaar B sawal kaun se hain? || Behave, Body, Background, Blood and nerves. || Behave, Body, Background, Blood aur nerves.
deeper: Red flags screening lesson || /learn/red-flags-screening || The basics of the screen used here. || Yahan istemal hone wali screen ki buniyaad.
deeper: Clinical reasoning thinking errors || /learn/clinical-reasoning-thinking-errors || Why we miss serious causes, and how to catch yourself. || Hum serious wajahein kyun miss karte hain, aur khud ko kaise pakdein.
source: Finucane LM, Downie A, Mercer C, et al. International framework for red flags for potential serious spinal pathologies. J Orthop Sports Phys Ther 2020;50:350-372. || international framework red flags potential serious spinal pathologies Finucane
source: Downie A, Williams CM, Henschke N, et al. Red flags to screen for malignancy and fracture in patients with low back pain: systematic review. BMJ 2013;347:f7095. || red flags malignancy fracture low back pain systematic review Downie
